{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も１日おつかれさまです\\(*^^*)/\nGWはゆっくりできましたか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/05/06/8399651/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？\n私は お稽古頑張っていましたよん..*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃ-です ..*  あっぷ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/05/06/8399651/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん今日は何していましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は お稽古\n終わってから ゆったんと二人で化粧水を買ったり フライパンを見たりしてきました!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は 横浜にて握手会がありました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/05/06/8399651/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれた皆 本当にありがとうございます..*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"優しい方ばかりなので、いつも「 嬉しゅうキモチっ 」になります.\n皆さんと会うたびに元気をもらいます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の洋服です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/05/06/8399651/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(４部 )"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/05/06/8399651/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやが『ロニーは今日もオシャレだね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/05/06/8399651/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"』\nかずみが『ろってぃ-は私より２年遅く産まれたのにオシャレだね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/05/06/8399651/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"』\nやまとが『それと同じの欲しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/05/06/8399651/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"』\nまいちゅんが『服めっちゃ可愛い..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/05/06/8399651/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"』\nマネージャー様が『ろってぃ-はやっぱそ-ゆ-の似合うよ//』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って いっぱい誉めてくれました゜゜(´O｀)°゜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/05/06/8399651/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆 いつも本当にありがとね。私は嬉しゅうよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この白のトップスの下の部分が\nシルバーのビーズやスパンコール等でキラキラ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/05/06/8399651/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しているので、中に着ている白のインナーは、肩ヒモの部分がシルバーのキラキラになってる物を着て トップスと合わせてみたりしました..*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"インナーまで細かく写真では分かんないんですけどね 笑てへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう１着 ( 5部 )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この服かわいくないですかあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/05/06/8399651/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？\nシャチがおる..*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/05/06/8399651/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"赤の膝丈スカートと合わせました^^\n靴下はまた足首が透けている靴下に頭にはリボン..*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/05/06/8399651/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんは どっちの洋服ですが好みですかあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/05/06/8399651/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ!! これも又、昨日放送された大阪での番組なんですけれども...   まいやんとななせと３人で『MUSIC EDGE 』とゆう番組に出させて頂きました !!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"動画検索して頂けたら 見れると思いますので是非見てくださいね*^^*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではでは また更新しますねん..*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい...  ろってぃ-"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/05/06/8399651/0010.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}